{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"cands\": [\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"他发现自己对那个人的欲望里已经有了直接的身体性满足，而且即使暂时没有更进一步的亲近，他也舍不得让这份感受停下来。\",\n      \"why\": \"他先前已经体验过，快乐越真实，就越想要得充分、长久；后来又发现，即使没能更充分地靠近对方，细细珍惜这份感情本身也能带来快乐。于是他不必立刻追问对方是不是也一样，自己对那个人的欲望便能继续加深。\",\n      \"depends\": [\"H4\", \"H5\", \"H12\", \"H13\", \"H14\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"S07-B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"他在幸福还没有减弱的时候，就已经开始为这一刻感到舍不得，心里也有了一点难过。\",\n      \"why\": \"他先前就在快乐仍然存在时体验过留不住同一刻的不安，后来又发现，过去的亲近会继续留在自己身上，既能温暖自己，也会让自己难过。所以这次幸福并没有减弱，他却已隐约感觉到它终究会成为回忆。\",\n      \"depends\": [\"H6\", \"H11\", \"H15\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"S07-B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"none\": \"\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "292206fc-4cab-4c0a-9f26-78025f78becf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T014823221078Z", "elapsed_seconds": 113.969, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T01:50:17.188569+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d67142e82446618624b7118afd6a80d53fe43de8441b624b58d212290e579e64", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968